<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka ends unchanged against dollar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka ends unchanged against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The taka closed unchanged at 42.5490/5500 to the U.S. dollar on Thursday after edging up to 42.5485/5500 in early trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Demand for the U.S. currency was higher than usual (and) banks wanted to remain long on the dollar in anticipation of a downward adjustment of the taka by the central bank,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +88-02-506363</p>
